{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note-header",
      "type": "canvas_note",
      "position": {
        "x": 20,
        "y": -220
      },
      "data": {
        "label": "Sinnamary S1+S2 Fusion — Phase 2",
        "params": {
          "text": "# Sinnamary S1+S2 Fusion — Phase 2\n\n**Goal:** Enrich the Phase 1 SAR-only baseline with Sentinel-2 spectral indices for better mangrove / orpaillage discrimination.\n\n**Why S2?** S1 alone confuses mangrove (double-bounce) with flooded non-mangrove wetlands, and bare orpaillage soil with natural river bars. S2 MNDWI + EVI break these ambiguities.\n\n## Pipeline\n🟦 **S1 branch (left):** S1 RTC 2024 → s1_polarization_features (6 radar indices)\n🟩 **S2 branch (centre):** S2 L2A 2024 → geo_spectral_indices (NDVI + MNDWI + EVI in one node) → 3-band stack\n🟧 **Fusion (right):** geo_band_stack merges S1 (6) + S2 (3) → 9-band feature raster\n🟥 **LULC change:** geo_time_align 2017→2024\n\n## Key simplification vs previous design\nThree separate `geo_spectral_index` nodes + two `geo_band_stack` chains replaced by **one `geo_spectral_indices` node** that outputs the 3-band `stack` directly.",
          "width": 1540,
          "height": 280,
          "fontSize": 13,
          "color_index": 4
        }
      },
      "width": 1155,
      "height": 336,
      "selected": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n-s1-2024",
      "type": "geo_copernicus",
      "position": {
        "x": -280,
        "y": -20
      },
      "data": {
        "params": {
          "node_note": "**S1 RTC 2024** — annual median composite, Sinnamary union BBOX. VV + VH in dB. Collection 5 = Sentinel-1 RTC (Planetary Computer, no auth). 20 m resolution.",
          "bbox": "-53.300000,4.400000,-52.600000,5.500000",
          "collection": "5",
          "date_start": "2024-01-01",
          "date_end": "2024-12-31",
          "resolution": "20",
          "stac_polarization": 0,
          "stac_orbit": 0,
          "stac_composite": 0,
          "stac_to_db": true,
          "stac_max_scenes": 10,
          "cache_dir": "copernicus_cache",
          "fetch": 0,
          "bands": "vv,vh",
          "cloud_max": "20"
        }
      },
      "width": 208,
      "height": 450,
      "selected": true,
      "positionAbsolute": {
        "x": -280,
        "y": -20
      },
      "dragging": false
    },
