          "node_note": "**S2 L2A 2024** — cloud-filtered composite (< 30 % cloud). Bands B04 B03 B02 B08 B11 = Red(1) Green(2) Blue(3) NIR(4) SWIR1(5). Band order matches the spectral_indices band assignments.",
          "bbox": "-53.300000,4.400000,-52.600000,5.500000",
